<title>UK: World Bank sets $100 mln 3-year step-up bond, call.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets $100 mln 3-year step-up bond, call.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Sanwa.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON    *6.0 PCT   MATURITY    18.NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    18.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  10 BP     REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES     *IN YEAR ONE, 6.5 PCT THEREAFTER IF NOT CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  5 BP	PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
